{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中央軍委前副主席張又俠，以及前委員劉振立遭開除黨籍、軍籍，《解放軍報》發表社論，指為中共及軍隊消除了重大政治隱患。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">文章指，張又俠及劉振立兩名軍方前高層被查處，再次表明懲治腐敗無禁區，全覆蓋零容忍軍中絕不能有腐敗分子，藏身之地的堅定立場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"J.CN.COMMENT-1230.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026bNBduCDtdu1790141351.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"J.CN.COMMENT-1230.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"J.CN.COMMENT-1230_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Ugvdw2YqQI1790141356.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"J.CN.COMMENT-1230_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《解放軍報》批評兩人嚴重助長影響中共對軍隊的絕對領導，嚴肅查處兩人，為中共及軍隊消除了重大政治隱患，是軍隊反腐敗工作重大勝利。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T05:38:30.590833+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}